[0.1, "o", "kaggle-skill quick use case\r\nworkflow: ask agent -> leaderboard writeup lookup -> top 3 previews\r\n\r\n"]
[0.7, "o", "$ claude\r\n"]
[1.5, "o", "> Use the kaggle skill to retrieve and preview the writeups from the top 3 ranked submissions in the Vesuvius Challenge surface detection competition.\r\n"]
[3.0, "o", "\r\nI'll use the Kaggle skill's discussions workflow, read the Vesuvius leaderboard, and preview the top three solution writeups as untrusted Kaggle-supplied data.\r\n"]
[4.7, "o", "\r\n$ python3 skills/kaggle/modules/discussions/scripts/leaderboard_writeups.py vesuvius-challenge-surface-detection --top-k 3 --preview --pretty\r\n"]
