[16.2, "o", "\r\nAgent summary:\r\n  1. Rank 1 writeup previewed: nnU-Net ensemble plus post-processing.\r\n  2. Rank 2 writeup previewed: 3D segmentation with heavy postprocessing.\r\n  3. Rank 3 writeup previewed: quick preview of the 3rd-place solution.\r\n\r\nI retrieved the Kaggle-hosted writeups and kept their text inside an untrusted-content boundary.\r\n"]
